        "type": "text/plain",
        "value": "<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <h3>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            Payroll Kaik\u014dkiri\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           - CLOSED\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </h3>\r\n  <h5>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           1.0 FTE Permanent Full time\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </h5>\r\n</div>\r\n<div data-rss-type=\"text\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u014ctaki Campus\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <br/>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           A position has arisen for a payroll administrator extraordinaire within our very busy Tiaki Rawa team located in \u014ctaki.\u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           The successful applicant will have a working knowledge of related payroll software, IRD practices and be a confident communicator. Confidentiality is a must in this role, as is your attention to detail as you ensure accuracy of information.\u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Further responsibilities include but are not limited to maintaining payroll databases, receiving and entering timesheets and information in a timely manner, updating staff files and assisting to prepare reports internally and externally as required.\u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           If you are looking to work within a kaupapa M\u0101ori environment with the opportunity for further study and to support the expansion of the m\u0101tauranga M\u0101ori continuum, then this is the role for you.\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            \u00a0\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           For further information or to apply for this role, please contact:\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           \u00a0\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Dionne Seng, Kaihaut\u016b Te Whare Tiaki Rawa\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n        \n            \u012am\u0113ra:\n           \r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n    <a href=\"mailto:dionne.seng@twor-otaki.ac.nz\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n      \n           dionne.seng@twor-otaki.ac.nz\n          \r\n    </a>\r\n    <span>\r\n      <span>\r\n      </span>\r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n  <p>\r\n    <span>\r\n      \n           Waea: 06 3649011 extn 757\n          \r\n    </span>\r\n  </p>\r\n</div>"
      }
